        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Esta pequeña batería es el as en la manga de Axiom. El kelón es una fuente de energía asombrosa y los ingenieros encuentran nuevos usos para ella cada día.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Diese kleine Batterie ist der Trumpf der Axiom. Das Kelon erzeugt eine phänomenale Energie, für die Ingenieure täglich neue Anwendungen finden.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Cette petite pile est la carte maîtresse de l'Axiom. Le Kélon produit une énergie phénoménale, pour laquelle les ingénieurs trouvent chaque jour de nouvelles applications.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Questa piccola batteria è l'asso nella manica degli Axiom. Il Kelon produce un'energia fenomenale a cui gli ingegneri dedicano nuovi impieghi ogni giorno.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "This little battery is Axiom's trump card. The Kelon produces phenomenal energy for which engineers find new applications every day.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        }
      },
      "id": "01HPME7WXR0S3DS6E8CASP05F0",
      "text": "This little battery is Axiom's trump card. The Kelon produces phenomenal energy for which engineers find new applications every day."
    }
  ],
